{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:15 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<p>何啟華（Dee@ERROR）與劉漪琳到土瓜灣齊為舞台劇《見面即地獄》綵排，Dee更以浴袍配以孖煙囪上陣，上演一場情慾戲份。Dee與劉漪琳受訪，二人笑劇中情慾戲非常勁，笑指琳琳姐是非常厲害的演員，因此壓力都在他身上。二人更打賭誰先「丟本」要請食飯，結果Dee將劇本留在綵排室，更忘了帶返屋企而要請食飯。Dee笑言正為演出積極訓練。</p>\n<img alt=\"何啟華與劉漪琳為舞台劇《見面即地獄》綵排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4db1b43d56892fe38de3862741d70f80/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_09_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Dee以浴袍配孖煙囪上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/121188113e25f6f4b3495086e3ffe601/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_09_23_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"笑言屆時上舞台會更清涼些。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/65de8239bfdce52841bc3b6d87d5e0f9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_09_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉漪琳自認冇性魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cbb21d0ebcc099c5bca03bed77ef7f22/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_09_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人笑劇中情慾戲非常勁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be40a47eade9d6c07cd0126529faa3d7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_09_24_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ali、陳湛文、何啟華與劉漪琳合力演出舞台劇《見面即地獄》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7f42728ed0bab1c862c7fc4e4c3cacab/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉漪琳騎住阿Dee。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7b48e9fad58d40d5d507d38ed7f128f9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_02_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"阿Dee投降。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5412a38dbc927dbc9ab5938db6a07245/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_02.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩人投入演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c17a8c280c1e87057a2d0a8a267c8b1f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Dee着孖煙囪演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93e96b5a5422f730f8de55159ee362c2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_03_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"相當投入。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b8dcc373e5d6db7fde527f27c648a267/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Dee冇偶包。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d873b2746941242071121d84167c5209/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_17_10_04_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>何啟華表明埋身肉搏「唔係收呢個價」</h2>\n<p>Dee以浴袍配孖煙囪上陣，笑言屆時上舞台會更清涼些，觀眾會有驚喜，問埋身肉搏？他笑言是意識形態，「埋牙就唔係收呢個價！」漪琳自認沒有性魅力，在綵排前一直尋找中，結果Dee親身示範給她看，非常好睇。Dee則笑言是朋友分享的經歷，自己也是在這些照片中長大，自覺做得好睇，將來扮女人相信幾有魅力。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:43:55.397914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T13:15:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:32.540998+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:37:25.122243+00:00","content_hash":"d624ee995242a31d7baabcedb3dc75a4db3237d728d035067adb64db6878d70a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}